<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46218" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζηλοτῠπ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be jealous of</i>, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζηλοτυπῶν με καὶ φθονῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					213d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αὑτοῦ γυναῖκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					12.532a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				472.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. δούλην ἐπὶ τῷ
				ἀνδρί</span> in regard to her husband, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.267d
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>emulate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τινὶ ἐπαινουμένῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.
					<u>Eloc.</u>
					292
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -ουμένη μεμοιχεῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.141
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>envy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				13.18.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				13.1
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τινά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					5.167c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c.acc. rei,
				<i>regard with jealous anger</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γιγνόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pretend to, affect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρμα ζηλοτυποῦν ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.211
				</span></i>
			; <i>imitate, follow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Θάλητος δόξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φερεκύδης</span>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ζηλοτυπουμένη τυραννίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arat.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			.</div>
